WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:24.100
If I open this door, I'll find a new world

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.520
A world only just beginning

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:34.770
Even if there are tough times ahead

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:41.160
I'm sure I'll make it through

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:48.580
Now I'm making my way through this new world

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:54.900
And I've got hopes and dreams

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.700
I'm excited, I'm restless

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.260
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:01.300
My heart is all fired up
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.430
My heart is all fired up

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.460
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:10.520
Taking to the sky
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.650
Taking to the sky

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:19.680
Aiming for tomorrow and beyond

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:26.060
I believe that someday I'll grow up

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.120
That's why I'll spread my wings wide

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:54.790
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.950
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.250
<i>And I'm Jasmine.</i>

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.420
<i>We're currently travelling to seven perilous places in order to recover the seven stolen gems!</i>

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:07.430
<i>We've already acquired the topaz,
ruby, opal, and the lapis lazuli!</i>

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.940
<i>We had to face some monsters, but they weren't anything we couldn't handle!</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.940
<i>Hey now, we don't know what kinds of enemies we'll have to face in the future. You both need to be careful.</i>

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.540
<i>Geez, you worry too much, Barda!</i>

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.250
<i>And right now, we're headed to
Dread Mountain where the fifth gem is located!</i>

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.930
H-Hey! Are you sure
you aren't flying too fast?

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:56.650
It seems that Kin can recover
their strength quite quickly.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.700
It's all thanks to the water!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:02.580
I can't even remember the last time I slept so soundly without having any dreams.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.880
Me too! It feels like I'm back
to the days of my prime, now!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.000
Oh, I see...

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:13.490
Everyone's sleep was always somewhat disturbed
from always drinking from the Dreaming Spring...

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:17.780
But losing sleep because you're busy dreaming is rather absurd, don't you think?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:21.510
And now, you're about to arrive at the place you've always dreamed of!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.100
Yes, I'm really excited!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:28.100
I actually woke up at one point last night...

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.400
because I felt like the others were nearby...

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:36.260
Perhaps Crenn and the others came
in their dreams to check on you.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:40.450
But... I had the feeling that they were
desperately trying to tell me something...

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.600
I hope nothing bad happened...

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:47.790
At any rate, we'd better hurry so we can get back to the others as soon as possible.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.300
Let's go!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.220
Katabra.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.620
Found you.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.520
So this is... Dread Mountain...

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.690
We've finally returned home!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.410
Yeah, and it's not just a dream!
Our home is right before us!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:36.340
There's no time to be nostalgic! From here on in, things are going to get serious. Don't let the Dread Gnomes shoot you down!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.160
Don't worry, we'll be fine!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.630
Here they come!

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.470
Hold on tight!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.870
So those are the Dread Gnomes?

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:55.520
Yes...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.190
Merin, Bruna, let's fly lower!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.240
We're going to land down there!

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.410
Is everyone okay?

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.140
Yes...

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.400
I'm fine, thanks.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.800
So these are Boolong trees...?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.400
I've never seen trees with
thorns like these before.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:41.810
And it's thanks to these thorns that we're able to protect ourselves from the Dread Gnomes.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:48.120
Since this area is full of Boolong trees, you can rest easy here. The Dread Gnomes hate their thorns.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:51.110
But, we can't move freely here either...

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:57.240
There's a small river just a short walking distance from here. Shall we head there for now?

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:00.300
Let's do that. It's also a good
place to take off from.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.790
So you guys are fine with the thorns?

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:12.090
Well, we have very tough hides, so these thorns don't really bother us at all.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:18.950
I must say, there really are a huge number of Boolong trees here. Is the rest of Dread Mountain like this too?

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:23.470
Actually, there weren't this many trees around when we used to live here.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:26.100
You could even walk between
them safely back then.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:32.020
I would guarantee that they exploded in number like this because the Kin were no longer around to eat their cones.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.980
Jasmine. Can you hear what
the Boolong trees are saying?

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:37.660
No, I can't hear a thing.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.200
They all seem to have closed off
their hearts out of fear.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:43.830
What's this...?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:44.900
What's wrong?

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.390
What's happened here?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.240
Is it the work of the Dread Gnomes?

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:02.300
No, it can't be them. They aren't strong enough to do something like this.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:09.100
Which means that there's probably something lurking on this mountain which is more frightening than the Dread Gnomes, then...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.100
Looks like a storm is coming...

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.900
Bad timing considering we finally
found a good place to rest, but,

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.000
it will be too dangerous to
remain out here in the storm.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:40.360
There are a few natural caves if you continue upstream. It should be perfect shelter during the storm.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:43.810
Alright! Then let's head there, everyone!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.430
I'm really sorry, Lief...!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:52.510
We have to leave now before the storm comes.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:57.730
The storms here are unforgiving and they usually last for several days...

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.000
Wait, don't you think that's a bit harsh?

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:05.770
Are you saying we should leave them alone on the mountain with a dangerous creature lurking around?!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:10.200
Have you forgotten the promise
that we made to Crenn, Merin?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.590
We agreed that we would
return as soon as possible!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.900
But this place is our land; our old home that we should have protected ourselves!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:20.690
I only realised it once we finally returned.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:26.400
Dread Mountain is where we belong! So let's bring the others back here too!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:31.030
The Dread Gnomes won't be able to get to us if we stay at the base of the mountain!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:36.900
But Merin, it was a miracle that we were even able to land here in the first place, you know!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.860
Do you want the see the others die again?

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:46.430
Besides, if everyone returned and ate the Boolong cones again, the Boolong trees would diminish in number.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:50.400
And when that day comes, the Dread Gnomes will be able to slaughter us once more!

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.720
But still...

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.000
We will be fine. Merin, Ailsa, and Bruna, thank you.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.300
We can't trouble you any more than this.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:03.510
We don't even know how we can return the
favour for carrying us all the way here.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.960
We don't need anything in return.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:11.250
While it wasn't for long, we were
able to see our old home again.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:14.800
And I even got all of these souvenirs
for the others who stayed!

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.100
Now, let's go, Merin.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:19.800
Okay...

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.200
Thank you so much, and take care.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.290
Give our regards to the others!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.760
You three take care as well.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.400
Let's meet again someday!

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.800
I'll definitely visit you in my dreams!

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.500
Thank you!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:42.750
Farewell!

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:54.970
Over there, huh...

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.110
Come, let's also go before the storm comes.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.500
We need to find a good place to hide for the night before it gets dark.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:10.900
Something is coming...

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.300
Is it the Dread Gnomes?

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:14.910
Let's just hide for now.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:23.510
They shouldn't be far from
here. Find them, at all costs!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:24.500
Right!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.820
Who <i>are</i> those guys?

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:27.970
Are they Grey Guards...?

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.900
They look a bit different to the
ones we've met before, though...

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.600
Either way, we'll have nowhere to
escape if they discover us here!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.300
We must keep quiet!

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:43.880
One of them came back!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.200
This is bad! Who is it? Is it Merin?!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.500
No, that's Prin!!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.310
Prin?!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:56.760
Lief! Jasmine! Barda!

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:00.810
Look out!

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:03.200
Stay away! Get out of here, Prin!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.230
Prin...!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.500
Search inside the Kin's pouch.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.340
We have to save her!

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:24.100
Damn it! Let's go, Lief!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:29.940
You're looking for us, aren't you?!

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:31.900
And here we are!

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:37.500
I applaud your bravery for showing yourselves.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:43.910
A brawny man, a young boy,
and a girl with a black bird...

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:46.300
There's no mistaking it. Kill them!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:15.920
My thanks, Lief.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.700
Jasmine, get to Prin now!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.250
You will not pass.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.210
Prin?! Prin?!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.530
Shit...! They're strong!

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.890
They're completely different to the Grey Guards we've faced before!

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.710
Hmph, obviously.

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:52.100
We are an elite squad operating
directly under the Shadow Lord.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.990
We are the Carn Unit; the hell hounds who pursue whatever the target, to the ends of the earth!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.410
Lief!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:10.520
Prin!!

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.910
Prin? Prin?!

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:18.780
Just hold on, Prin.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:21.300
I'll save you right now!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.500
That was the last of it. I hope it's enough...

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.110
Please...! Please let it work!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.120
Lief!!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.400
This is the end.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:02.930
A Vraal?!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.610
What a powerful creature...!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:23.680
The Vraal are the strongest and most terrible
monsters ever bred to fight in the Shadow Arena.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:26.900
Once their rampage begins, there
is nothing that can stop them!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.440
Are you alright, Lief?!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.270
Y-Yeah...

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.000
Enough. Fall back.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.680
We will retreat and leave the rest to the Vraal.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:49.600
You two may enjoy your last
fight before your death.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.390
Lief, Barda!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.300
A green monster is attacking them...?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.400
Filli, Kree, I'm leaving Prin with you!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.240
Goddamn it!

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.310
Lief, Barda!

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.280
There! I can use that!

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.920
Lief, Barda! Move aside!!

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.200
Are you guys okay?!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.200
You saved us...!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:10.510
So you used the nectar
of the Lilies of Life, huh...

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.980
Yeah, so she just has to revive!

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:15.400
Prin...

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:24.930
Prin! Are you awake now?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.650
Prin!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.200
Did I fall down back there...?

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:34.080
That's right; you were also hit
by a Dread Gnome's arrow.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:38.560
Why did you come after us alone?! I'm sure the others are worried sick about you right now.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:44.140
But I was really sure that I wouldn't get another chance to see my old home if I didn't go...

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:48.480
That's why I secretly followed Ailsa
and the others from behind.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.570
Huh? Why are you guys
covered in bruises...?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:56.250
I thought I got hurt too...
Was that all a dream...?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.500
It wasn't a dream. You did get hurt.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:04.870
But fortunately, we had magic healing nectar with us, so we were able to bring you back to life.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:09.700
Do you understand how the adult Kin would feel if something were to happen to you?

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:13.900
But I'm fine now! By the way,
where's Ailsa and the others?

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.850
They'll be really surprised when
they see that I'm here too!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:23.190
I bet they never would've thought
that I could fly this far, after all!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.200
Ailsa and the others already went back.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.770
And you can't get back on your own, right? So what will you do now?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.400
Then, why not come with
us for the time being?

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.360
Really?! I can stay with you guys?!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.860
But that's too dangerous!

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:44.760
Prin came here of her own accord, you know? So whatever happens to her, it's her responsibility.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:48.520
But we're heading to the Dread
Gnome's lair now, remember?

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.850
She may still be a child, but Prin
is still a Kin through and through!

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:56.420
She can guide us through the Boolong
forest just as Ailsa and the other two did!

00:17:57.140 --> 00:18:03.300
I'm not having it. We can't afford to bring another dead weight with us! She will only slow us down!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.570
And just what do you mean by that?!

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.420
When have I ever been
dead weight to you guys?!

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.400
There's no need to raise your
voices like that, you two.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.300
Look, you're scaring Prin.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.560
That's not it...! Look...!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.220
What a creature! It's still alive after all that?!

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.850
Jasmine, take Prin somewhere safe!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:30.440
Right!

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.110
Barda!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:41.500
Lief...!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.100
Get out of here and protect the belt!!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.210
Like hell I can do that!!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:51.000
Just do as I say! It's going to kill
us all at this rate! Go, quickly!

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.150
Jasmine!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:24.480
Prin...!

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.820
Stop, Prin! It's too dangerous; get out of here!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:29.220
It's okay! Just leave this to me!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:01.890
'Green moss is good moss to heal up the pain.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:05.330
But never touch the purple moss
because purple means poison!'

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:09.480
Mama always said that before,
but it seems like it really is true!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.660
We owe you one, Prin.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.900
At the rate things were going,
we would have been wiped out.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:28.000
Thank you.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.770
You have my thanks as well.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:33.210
See? It's good to have me around, right?

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:37.300
Yes, I'm sorry for saying
you were dead weight before.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.410
It was a bit scary, but I
decided to be courageous!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.900
It was very painful to even touch
that purple moss, you know?

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:53.620
And since I rubbed it all over its face, that monster shouldn't be able to do bad things for a while!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:58.970
And thanks to the green moss that you
gathered, our injuries are healing well too.

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:05.980
'Green moss is good moss to heal up the pain. But never touch the purple moss because purple means poison!'

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:10.200
Mama and the other adults often
sang that song when I was little.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:16.110
But no one told me that there was a scary monster like that on the mountain...

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:21.330
That monster must have come to the forest after the Kin left Dread Mountain.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.640
It never showed up in their dreams, either.

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:29.400
Well, that's one downside to the dreams. You can only see what the dream shows you.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.400
What's more, they only last for a short while.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:41.470
Prin, have the adult Kin ever said anything about
travellers like us living on Dread Mountain before?

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:43.860
No. Why do you ask?

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:48.400
Because it seems that we are not the
first humans to have found this place.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:49.440
What do you mean?

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:06.400
"Who am I? All is darkness but I will not despair.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.800
Three things I know:

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:11.500
I know I am a man.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.040
I know where I have been.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:16.900
I know what I must do.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:19.300
For now, that is enough."

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:51.300
On nights when a gentle breeze caresses your cheek

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:53.800
And you start walking with your head held high

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:57.930
You might just be blessed by the big red sun

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:00.560
When hardships cause you to stumble

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:03.020
And you keep hanging your head in shame

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:07.900
Just know that you may end up missing out on that one emotional scene

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:10.860
The Earth, with all of its living things

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:13.490
